{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/Banner.png?t=1748782543\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a young wizard, freshly graduated from the Academy and assigned to a remote coastal town with a troubled past. Though once a place of beauty, the town is now weighed down by lingering spirits, old conflicts, and creatures hiding in the mist. You\u2019ve learned magic. Now, can you use it for something that truly matters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/elementals.gif?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER ELEMENTAL WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore haunted dungeons to uncover the 13 lost elements. Forage rare items, craft magical tools, and harness powerful elemental weapons in battle. Exorcise hostile spirits and turn them into loyal followers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/walk-1__1_.gif?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR CASTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform an ancient farm into a grand castle as your wizard career advances. Grow rare herbs, raise magical creatures, and unlock rooms that support your magical pursuits. Invite friends and mystical beings to share life in your growing estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/0601__1___1_.gif?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE YOUR MASTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ranks from Apprentice to Archmage by mastering your magical skills. Unlock special outfits, discover new abilities, and shape your playstyle with buffs that reflect your unique strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULFILL REQUESTS FOR TOWNSPEOPLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/people_of_starfall.png?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete tasks for the townspeople, from brewing potions to easing everyday troubles. Build friendships, uncover personal stories, and experience moments that may lead to unexpected romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/ricardo__4_.gif?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DATE &amp; LIVE TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with characters of all sexes through heart events, festivals, and shared adventures. Fall in love, get married, and invite your partner to live with you in the castle. Decorate your home together and experience daily life as a magical couple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/extras/steampage_wishlist.gif?t=1748782543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195450?t=1748782543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/1bbe6e961f298a95580aa4be0ea0e0517c77abc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748782543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195450/a2fa1815a4b4fdf10893079413c2ef5e1bc909d5/ca